class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">息を呑む至近距離ピストンと極上フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Djur00141&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">息子ほど年の離れたバイト先の男子学生達と一泊二日の温泉旅行に来た美熟女パート主婦はお酒に酔うとノリノリで…俺たちみんな39歳パート主婦ひびきさんのガチ恋勢 大槻ひびき <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">FJIN00057</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">大槻ひびき</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">FunCity/妄想族</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">息を呑む至近距離ピストンと極上フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dfjin00057&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 作品別徹底詳細レビュー（1作品ずつ長文解説） -->\n  <section class=\"space-y-12\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-l-4 border-pink-500 pl-3\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white\">【完全個別レビュー】厳選収録タイトルの深層解説</h3>\n    </div>\n    <article class=\"bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-2xl\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-4 border-b border-slate-800\">\n        <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-full shadow\">FILE 01</span>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-pink-400 tracking-wider\">品番: JUR00425</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4 class=\"text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-white leading-snug hover:text-pink-400 transition\">毎晩旦那とヤリまくる絶倫叔母と一泊二日の搾精旅行 ヌカれまくって性に目覚めた童貞の僕は… すべて忘れて連続中出し交尾にハマってしまった。 古東まりこ</h4>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start\">\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-3\">\n          <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 shadow-inner group\">\n            <img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/jur00425/jur00425pl.jpg\" alt=\"毎晩旦那とヤリまくる絶倫叔母と一泊二日の搾精旅行 ヌカれまくって性に目覚めた童貞の僕は… すべて忘れて連続中出し交尾にハマってしまった。 古東まりこ\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-3 bg-slate-950/80 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 text-xs space-y-1 text-slate-400 font-mono\">\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">出演女優:</strong> 古東まりこ</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">メーカー:</strong> マドンナ</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">レーベル:</strong> Madonna</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">参考価格:</strong> 250~</div>\n          </div>\n          <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Djur00425&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block w-full text-center py-3 px-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-600 to-rose-600 hover:from-pink-500 hover:to-rose-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition duration-150\">\n            FANZA公式で作品詳細・本編を見る ➔\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base\">\n          <div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl border-l-2 border-pink-500\">\n            <h5 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-400 font-bold mb-1\">作品あら